Data sources
------------

  JPL DE 440 ephemerides
      NASA / Jet Propulsion Laboratory
      https://ssd.jpl.nasa.gov/planets/eph_export.html

  IERS Earth orientation parameters
  (finals.all, finals2000A.all, itrf-versions.conf)
      International Earth Rotation and Reference Systems Service
      https://www.iers.org/  https://datacenter.iers.org/

  Leap seconds (tai-utc.dat)
      U.S. Naval Observatory
      https://maia.usno.navy.mil/

  Marshall Solar Activity Future Estimation (MSAFE)
      NASA Marshall Space Flight Center
      https://www.nasa.gov/

  CSSI space weather data
      AGI / CelesTrak
      https://ftp.agi.com/pub/DynamicEarthData/

  Space environment data (JB2008 indices)
      https://sol.spacenvironment.net/JB2008/

  Eigen-6S gravity field
      GFZ German Research Centre for Geosciences / IGG
      https://icgem.gfz-potsdam.de/

  FES 2004 ocean tides
      LEGOS / CLS (now NOVELTIS)
      https://os.copernicus.eu/
